      "updated": 1780442566879,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Displays data from the Community\n  PDS (hydrates shared records)\n- Lets community members log in to\n  e.g. RSVP to events\n- Lets logged in users join the\n  community by delegating writes \n  to Open Social*\n- Creates problems on purpose",
      "rawText": "- Displays data from the Community\n  PDS (hydrates shared records)\n- Lets community members log in to\n  e.g. RSVP to events\n- Lets logged in users join the\n  community by delegating writes \n  to Open Social*\n- Creates problems on purpose",
